msgctxt "92"
msgid "That explosion at Millennium Tower last year was crazy, wasn't it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"Didn't a yakuza family have their office there or something? The Kazama "
"Family, I think... I was told the place was blown sky high. Scary."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"I heard their leader got out okay, though. And what's more, they still have "
"an office there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"Leave it to the yakuza. That takes some serious balls. I wouldn't go back "
"after something like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"The yakuza ain't about to let themselves be intimidated. They can't afford "
"to turn tail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"Still, doesn't it seem like that building blows up every year? I wonder if "
"it'll happen this year, too..."
msgstr ""

